  "instance_name": "ableism",
  "label": "Ableism",
  "description": "The meme implicitly uses ableist tropes by mocking Trump's physical inability to swing a bat, reducing his perceived competence to a physical caricature. Ableism involves the discrimination or devaluation of people based on their physical or mental abilities. In this case, the meme suggests that Trump's physical weakness (inability to swing) makes him unfit for leadership, which is a form of ableist humor that reinforces the idea that physical capability is essential for leadership or competence.",
